<title>UK: Chase Manhattan sets $500 mln five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Chase Manhattan sets $500 mln five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue</p>
<p>was announced by lead manager Chase.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CHASE MANHATTAN CORP</p>
<p> AMT	  $500 MLN  BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    21.AUG.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +5 BP     PAY DATE    21.AUG.97</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 ISS PRICE  99.913    FULL FEES   0.175</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  REOFFER    99.913</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) =	   SALE LIMITS US</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  0.05	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
